### V1 - no token - expect 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets

###

### Login to get a token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "day9demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### V1 - with valid token - expect 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Old unversioned endpoint still works - expect 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Ticket report by status - expect 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Ticket report by priority - expect 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-priority
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
